&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;8+ years of large enterprise software sales experience and well-developed pattern recognition for navigating complex organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
