&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions. As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact. During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fivetran and dbt are seeking an experienced Compliance, Employment &amp;amp; Litigation Counsel to join our Legal team. This role will focus on global compliance, employment counseling and employment-related legal support across the United States and potentially internationally, as well as assisting with a variety of dispute and litigation matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will help provide legal guidance related to global compliance and to develop standards and operationalize compliance policies to support the maturation and expansion of the Company’s compliance infrastructure. You will partner closely with our People Team and business partners to provide practical, business-focused employment advice on a broad range of workforce issues. You will also work alongside other members of the Legal team, to manage business disputes, including contract disputes, vendor disputes, bankruptcy matters, intellectual property issues, privacy-related claims, and other litigation matters as they arise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for an attorney who enjoys combining compliance and day-to-day employment counseling with litigation and dispute management in a fast-paced technology company. The successful candidate will have compliance, employment law, and litigation experience, and the ability to independently manage legal matters while collaborating effectively across functions. This position will report to the VP, Compliance, Employment &amp;amp; Litigation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is a full-time hybrid position based in our Denver, CO, and Oakland, CA, offices. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop policies and procedures related to ethics, export control, sanctions, anti-corruption, and conflicts of interest to encourage a culture of compliance with rules and regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct internal investigations of compliance issues, business partner and government inquiries, and handle responses and resolution and assist with overseeing compliance hotline monitoring, responses, resolutions and reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oversee compliance training and related programs to foster a culture of compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Stay informed of peer company best practices and relevant global legal developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive creative, customer-focused, practical and proactive legal guidance enabling the Company to execute on its goals, objectives, mission, vision and values in a compliant and ethical way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Employment Counseling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advise the People Team, and business partners on a wide range of employment law matters across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Provide legal guidance on hiring, performance management, accommodations, leaves of absence, workplace investigations, disciplinary actions, and terminations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support organizational changes, workforce planning initiatives, restructurings, and reductions in force.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Draft, review, and update employment-related agreements, policies, procedures, and training materials.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Monitor legal developments and advise the business on emerging employment law requirements and risks, including AI-related developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support employment-related matters across the United States and internationally, in collaboration with internal and external partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Litigation &amp;amp; Dispute Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage employment-related claims, administrative charges, demand letters, arbitrations, and litigation matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support and manage disputes involving commercial contracts, vendors, intellectual property, privacy, bankruptcy, and other legal issues, working with internal stakeholders and outside counsel as appropriate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct factual investigations and work with internal stakeholders to collect information, preserve evidence, and prepare witnesses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage outside counsel and associated legal budgets for assigned matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and manage discovery and e-discovery related processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Assess legal and business risk and provide practical recommendations regarding dispute resolution strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support the development and implementation of processes that reduce litigation risk and improve dispute management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate effectively with all business teams across the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver practical, solution-oriented legal advice that balances risk management with business objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to special projects and strategic initiatives as the company continues to grow globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Help build scalable legal processes that support a high-growth technology business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;J.D. from an accredited law school and licensed to practice law&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4-7 years of experience, including significant compliance, employment and/or litigation experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong judgment and ability to provide practical, business-oriented legal advice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A problem-solving mentality, willing to make a call and be an active decision maker.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Orientation towards process and operations, and ability to spot and act on improvements to systems, standards, templates, policies and practices that help reduce risk, remove friction, and propel the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent written, verbal, and interpersonal communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to independently manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability and willingness to work across time zones as needed; some travel may be required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong preference for prior in-house experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting a high-growth technology or SaaS company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience advising on employment matters outside of the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience handling commercial disputes, contract disputes, vendor disputes, intellectual property matters, privacy-related disputes, or bankruptcy matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding and experience handling complex e-discovery issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID #LI-SR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Oakland Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$186,895&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$224,283 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time-off policy (PTO), plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave policy, holidays (including a year end Global Week of Rest), and volunteer days off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions. As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact. During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fivetran and dbt are seeking an experienced Compliance, Employment &amp;amp; Litigation Counsel to join our Legal team. This role will focus on global compliance, employment counseling and employment-related legal support across the United States and potentially internationally, as well as assisting with a variety of dispute and litigation matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will help provide legal guidance related to global compliance and to develop standards and operationalize compliance policies to support the maturation and expansion of the Company’s compliance infrastructure. You will partner closely with our People Team and business partners to provide practical, business-focused employment advice on a broad range of workforce issues. You will also work alongside other members of the Legal team, to manage business disputes, including contract disputes, vendor disputes, bankruptcy matters, intellectual property issues, privacy-related claims, and other litigation matters as they arise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for an attorney who enjoys combining compliance and day-to-day employment counseling with litigation and dispute management in a fast-paced technology company. The successful candidate will have compliance, employment law, and litigation experience, and the ability to independently manage legal matters while collaborating effectively across functions. This position will report to the VP, Compliance, Employment &amp;amp; Litigation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is a full-time hybrid position based in our Austin, TX office. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop policies and procedures related to ethics, export control, sanctions, anti-corruption, and conflicts of interest to encourage a culture of compliance with rules and regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct internal investigations of compliance issues, business partner and government inquiries, and handle responses and resolution and assist with overseeing compliance hotline monitoring, responses, resolutions and reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oversee compliance training and related programs to foster a culture of compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Stay informed of peer company best practices and relevant global legal developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive creative, customer-focused, practical and proactive legal guidance enabling the Company to execute on its goals, objectives, mission, vision and values in a compliant and ethical way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Employment Counseling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advise the People Team, and business partners on a wide range of employment law matters across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Provide legal guidance on hiring, performance management, accommodations, leaves of absence, workplace investigations, disciplinary actions, and terminations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support organizational changes, workforce planning initiatives, restructurings, and reductions in force.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Draft, review, and update employment-related agreements, policies, procedures, and training materials.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Monitor legal developments and advise the business on emerging employment law requirements and risks, including AI-related developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support employment-related matters across the United States and internationally, in collaboration with internal and external partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Litigation &amp;amp; Dispute Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage employment-related claims, administrative charges, demand letters, arbitrations, and litigation matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support and manage disputes involving commercial contracts, vendors, intellectual property, privacy, bankruptcy, and other legal issues, working with internal stakeholders and outside counsel as appropriate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct factual investigations and work with internal stakeholders to collect information, preserve evidence, and prepare witnesses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage outside counsel and associated legal budgets for assigned matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and manage discovery and e-discovery related processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Assess legal and business risk and provide practical recommendations regarding dispute resolution strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support the development and implementation of processes that reduce litigation risk and improve dispute management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate effectively with all business teams across the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver practical, solution-oriented legal advice that balances risk management with business objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to special projects and strategic initiatives as the company continues to grow globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Help build scalable legal processes that support a high-growth technology business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;J.D. from an accredited law school and licensed to practice law&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4-7 years of experience, including significant compliance, employment and/or litigation experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong judgment and ability to provide practical, business-oriented legal advice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A problem-solving mentality, willing to make a call and be an active decision maker.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Orientation towards process and operations, and ability to spot and act on improvements to systems, standards, templates, policies and practices that help reduce risk, remove friction, and propel the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent written, verbal, and interpersonal communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to independently manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability and willingness to work across time zones as needed; some travel may be required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong preference for prior in-house experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting a high-growth technology or SaaS company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience advising on employment matters outside of the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience handling commercial disputes, contract disputes, vendor disputes, intellectual property matters, privacy-related disputes, or bankruptcy matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding and experience handling complex e-discovery issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID #LI-SR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$175,214&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$210,265.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time-off policy (PTO), plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave policy, holidays (including a year end Global Week of Rest), and volunteer days off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions. As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact. During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fivetran and dbt are seeking an experienced Compliance, Employment &amp;amp; Litigation Counsel to join our Legal team. This role will focus on global compliance, employment counseling and employment-related legal support across the United States and potentially internationally, as well as assisting with a variety of dispute and litigation matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will help provide legal guidance related to global compliance and to develop standards and operationalize compliance policies to support the maturation and expansion of the Company’s compliance infrastructure. You will partner closely with our People Team and business partners to provide practical, business-focused employment advice on a broad range of workforce issues. You will also work alongside other members of the Legal team, to manage business disputes, including contract disputes, vendor disputes, bankruptcy matters, intellectual property issues, privacy-related claims, and other litigation matters as they arise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for an attorney who enjoys combining compliance and day-to-day employment counseling with litigation and dispute management in a fast-paced technology company. The successful candidate will have compliance, employment law, and litigation experience, and the ability to independently manage legal matters while collaborating effectively across functions. This position will report to the VP, Compliance, Employment &amp;amp; Litigation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is a full-time hybrid position based in our Denver, CO, and Oakland, CA, offices. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop policies and procedures related to ethics, export control, sanctions, anti-corruption, and conflicts of interest to encourage a culture of compliance with rules and regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct internal investigations of compliance issues, business partner and government inquiries, and handle responses and resolution and assist with overseeing compliance hotline monitoring, responses, resolutions and reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oversee compliance training and related programs to foster a culture of compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Stay informed of peer company best practices and relevant global legal developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive creative, customer-focused, practical and proactive legal guidance enabling the Company to execute on its goals, objectives, mission, vision and values in a compliant and ethical way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Employment Counseling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advise the People Team, and business partners on a wide range of employment law matters across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Provide legal guidance on hiring, performance management, accommodations, leaves of absence, workplace investigations, disciplinary actions, and terminations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support organizational changes, workforce planning initiatives, restructurings, and reductions in force.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Draft, review, and update employment-related agreements, policies, procedures, and training materials.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Monitor legal developments and advise the business on emerging employment law requirements and risks, including AI-related developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support employment-related matters across the United States and internationally, in collaboration with internal and external partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Litigation &amp;amp; Dispute Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage employment-related claims, administrative charges, demand letters, arbitrations, and litigation matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support and manage disputes involving commercial contracts, vendors, intellectual property, privacy, bankruptcy, and other legal issues, working with internal stakeholders and outside counsel as appropriate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct factual investigations and work with internal stakeholders to collect information, preserve evidence, and prepare witnesses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage outside counsel and associated legal budgets for assigned matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and manage discovery and e-discovery related processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Assess legal and business risk and provide practical recommendations regarding dispute resolution strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support the development and implementation of processes that reduce litigation risk and improve dispute management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate effectively with all business teams across the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver practical, solution-oriented legal advice that balances risk management with business objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to special projects and strategic initiatives as the company continues to grow globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Help build scalable legal processes that support a high-growth technology business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;J.D. from an accredited law school and licensed to practice law&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4-7 years of experience, including significant compliance, employment and/or litigation experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong judgment and ability to provide practical, business-oriented legal advice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A problem-solving mentality, willing to make a call and be an active decision maker.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Orientation towards process and operations, and ability to spot and act on improvements to systems, standards, templates, policies and practices that help reduce risk, remove friction, and propel the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent written, verbal, and interpersonal communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to independently manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability and willingness to work across time zones as needed; some travel may be required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong preference for prior in-house experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting a high-growth technology or SaaS company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience advising on employment matters outside of the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience handling commercial disputes, contract disputes, vendor disputes, intellectual property matters, privacy-related disputes, or bankruptcy matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding and experience handling complex e-discovery issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID #LI-SR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Denver Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$175,214&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$210,265.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time-off policy (PTO), plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave policy, holidays (including a year end Global Week of Rest), and volunteer days off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions. As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact. During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fivetran and dbt are seeking an experienced Compliance, Employment &amp;amp; Litigation Counsel to join our Legal team. This role will focus on global compliance, employment counseling and employment-related legal support across the United States and potentially internationally, as well as assisting with a variety of dispute and litigation matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will help provide legal guidance related to global compliance and to develop standards and operationalize compliance policies to support the maturation and expansion of the Company’s compliance infrastructure. You will partner closely with our People Team and business partners to provide practical, business-focused employment advice on a broad range of workforce issues. You will also work alongside other members of the Legal team, to manage business disputes, including contract disputes, vendor disputes, bankruptcy matters, intellectual property issues, privacy-related claims, and other litigation matters as they arise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for an attorney who enjoys combining compliance and day-to-day employment counseling with litigation and dispute management in a fast-paced technology company. The successful candidate will have compliance, employment law, and litigation experience, and the ability to independently manage legal matters while collaborating effectively across functions. This position will report to the VP, Compliance, Employment &amp;amp; Litigation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is a full-time hybrid position based in our Philadelphia, PA office. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop policies and procedures related to ethics, export control, sanctions, anti-corruption, and conflicts of interest to encourage a culture of compliance with rules and regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct internal investigations of compliance issues, business partner and government inquiries, and handle responses and resolution and assist with overseeing compliance hotline monitoring, responses, resolutions and reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oversee compliance training and related programs to foster a culture of compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Stay informed of peer company best practices and relevant global legal developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive creative, customer-focused, practical and proactive legal guidance enabling the Company to execute on its goals, objectives, mission, vision and values in a compliant and ethical way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Employment Counseling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advise the People Team, and business partners on a wide range of employment law matters across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Provide legal guidance on hiring, performance management, accommodations, leaves of absence, workplace investigations, disciplinary actions, and terminations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support organizational changes, workforce planning initiatives, restructurings, and reductions in force.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Draft, review, and update employment-related agreements, policies, procedures, and training materials.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Monitor legal developments and advise the business on emerging employment law requirements and risks, including AI-related developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support employment-related matters across the United States and internationally, in collaboration with internal and external partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Litigation &amp;amp; Dispute Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage employment-related claims, administrative charges, demand letters, arbitrations, and litigation matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support and manage disputes involving commercial contracts, vendors, intellectual property, privacy, bankruptcy, and other legal issues, working with internal stakeholders and outside counsel as appropriate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct factual investigations and work with internal stakeholders to collect information, preserve evidence, and prepare witnesses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage outside counsel and associated legal budgets for assigned matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and manage discovery and e-discovery related processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Assess legal and business risk and provide practical recommendations regarding dispute resolution strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support the development and implementation of processes that reduce litigation risk and improve dispute management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate effectively with all business teams across the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver practical, solution-oriented legal advice that balances risk management with business objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to special projects and strategic initiatives as the company continues to grow globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Help build scalable legal processes that support a high-growth technology business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;J.D. from an accredited law school and licensed to practice law&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4-7 years of experience, including significant compliance, employment and/or litigation experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong judgment and ability to provide practical, business-oriented legal advice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A problem-solving mentality, willing to make a call and be an active decision maker.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Orientation towards process and operations, and ability to spot and act on improvements to systems, standards, templates, policies and practices that help reduce risk, remove friction, and propel the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent written, verbal, and interpersonal communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to independently manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability and willingness to work across time zones as needed; some travel may be required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong preference for prior in-house experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting a high-growth technology or SaaS company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience advising on employment matters outside of the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience handling commercial disputes, contract disputes, vendor disputes, intellectual property matters, privacy-related disputes, or bankruptcy matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding and experience handling complex e-discovery issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID #LI-SR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$175,214&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$210,265.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time-off policy (PTO), plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave policy, holidays (including a year end Global Week of Rest), and volunteer days off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions. As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact. During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fivetran and dbt are seeking an experienced Compliance, Employment &amp;amp; Litigation Counsel to join our Legal team. This role will focus on global compliance, employment counseling and employment-related legal support across the United States and potentially internationally, as well as assisting with a variety of dispute and litigation matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will help provide legal guidance related to global compliance and to develop standards and operationalize compliance policies to support the maturation and expansion of the Company’s compliance infrastructure. You will partner closely with our People Team and business partners to provide practical, business-focused employment advice on a broad range of workforce issues. You will also work alongside other members of the Legal team, to manage business disputes, including contract disputes, vendor disputes, bankruptcy matters, intellectual property issues, privacy-related claims, and other litigation matters as they arise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for an attorney who enjoys combining compliance and day-to-day employment counseling with litigation and dispute management in a fast-paced technology company. The successful candidate will have compliance, employment law, and litigation experience, and the ability to independently manage legal matters while collaborating effectively across functions. This position will report to the VP, Compliance, Employment &amp;amp; Litigation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is a full-time hybrid position based in our New York, NY office. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop policies and procedures related to ethics, export control, sanctions, anti-corruption, and conflicts of interest to encourage a culture of compliance with rules and regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct internal investigations of compliance issues, business partner and government inquiries, and handle responses and resolution and assist with overseeing compliance hotline monitoring, responses, resolutions and reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oversee compliance training and related programs to foster a culture of compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Stay informed of peer company best practices and relevant global legal developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive creative, customer-focused, practical and proactive legal guidance enabling the Company to execute on its goals, objectives, mission, vision and values in a compliant and ethical way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Employment Counseling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advise the People Team, and business partners on a wide range of employment law matters across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Provide legal guidance on hiring, performance management, accommodations, leaves of absence, workplace investigations, disciplinary actions, and terminations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support organizational changes, workforce planning initiatives, restructurings, and reductions in force.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Draft, review, and update employment-related agreements, policies, procedures, and training materials.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Monitor legal developments and advise the business on emerging employment law requirements and risks, including AI-related developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support employment-related matters across the United States and internationally, in collaboration with internal and external partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Litigation &amp;amp; Dispute Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Manage employment-related claims, administrative charges, demand letters, arbitrations, and litigation matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
