&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience managing complex, global relationships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of the modern data stack and the business value of open data infrastructure — dbt, Fivetran, or equivalent experience strongly preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to engage credibly at C-suite and partner level within a global technology organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
