&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are excited to be growing our Business Development organization and are currently seeking a Commercial Business Development Manager to join our Denver team. In this role, you will have a high impact position within our sales organization, overseeing the recruitment, performance, and culture of our Commercial Business Development team in our beautiful Denver office. You will work closely with Sales and Marketing Management to ensure the effective generation of pipelines. Your responsibilities will include managing, developing, and implementing strategic tactics for both inbound and outbound business development. Additionally, you will play a vital role in our marketing and sales leadership team, contributing to the shaping of our BDR program as we expand globally. This position will report to our BDR Director.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time position based out of our Denver office. You will be expected to work from our Denver office 3 days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
