&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Effectively allocate resources, such as time and effort, to different tasks, considering the available resources and constraints.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
