&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You have the ability to advise on dbt Platform recommendations, and build direction/consensus with the customer to move forward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
