&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Analyst to support our People organization&lt;/strong&gt;, using data to help Fivetran attract, develop, engage, and retain exceptional talent as we scale. You’ll work across the employee lifecycle — from recruiting and workforce planning to employee experience, learning and development, performance, and retention — turning complex people data into insights that shape how we build and support our teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a high-impact, highly cross-functional role for someone who enjoys operating at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;data, people, and strategy&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll partner closely with leaders across People, Recruiting, Finance, and the broader business to answer important organizational questions, develop scalable analytical frameworks, and improve how decisions are made.&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, flexible hybrid position based out of our Oakland, CA or NYC, NY office. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration. There is no mandate on the number of days required but we encourage employees to come in every week to collaborate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;SQL (BigQuery / Snowflake)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;dbt / dbt State&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Looker / LookML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Sigma / Hex / Google Sheets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Claude Code / Codex&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;HRIS, ATS, and other People systems and data sources&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and own our core People metrics.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish clear definitions and reporting across areas such as headcount, hiring, retention, organizational health, employee experience, and talent development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable analytical products.&lt;/strong&gt; Create canonical datasets, models, and self-service tools and dashboards that enable People teams and leaders to answer important questions quickly and consistently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as a trusted thought partner.&lt;/strong&gt; Translate analyses into clear narratives and recommendations for audiences ranging from functional operators to senior executive leadership. Work closely with our Engineers to improve Fivetran&#39;s own HRIS and ATS connectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a high bar for responsible People Analytics.&lt;/strong&gt; Help establish strong practices around data quality, integrity, governance, privacy, appropriate access, and the responsible use of sensitive employee data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn people data into decisions.&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze complex and disparate datasets to identify trends, surface opportunities, and provide actionable recommendations to People leaders and business stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our analytics culture.&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor other analysts and partners, establish analytical best practices, and help People teams develop stronger data fluency and decision-making habits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in analytics, data science, business intelligence, or a related analytical role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL and data modeling, with experience working across large, complex datasets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using Looker, Tableau, Sigma, or similar business intelligence and visualization tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical judgment and a track record of translating ambiguous business questions into structured analyses and actionable recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and a high bar for data quality, analytical rigor, and reproducibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and data storytelling skills; you can make complex findings intuitive and help decision-makers understand not just what is happening, but why it matters and what to do next&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in ambiguity, developing hypotheses, and owning analytical problems end-to-end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong cross-functional instincts and the ability to build trusted relationships with both technical and non-technical partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A builder mindset: you look beyond answering one-off questions and create frameworks, datasets, and tools that make future decisions faster and better&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for using data to improve how organizations attract, develop, and support their people&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using analytics to support key business decisions, preferably at a high-growth, SaaS, or B2B product company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in People Analytics, workforce analytics, recruiting analytics, HR strategy, or another People-related analytical function&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with HRIS, ATS, performance management, engagement, or learning systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID #LI-DJ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Oakland Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$156,082&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,102.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time-off policy (PTO), plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave policy, holidays (including a year end Global Week of Rest), and volunteer days off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact. During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Analyst to support our People organization&lt;/strong&gt;, using data to help Fivetran attract, develop, engage, and retain exceptional talent as we scale. You’ll work across the employee lifecycle — from recruiting and workforce planning to employee experience, learning and development, performance, and retention — turning complex people data into insights that shape how we build and support our teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a high-impact, highly cross-functional role for someone who enjoys operating at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;data, people, and strategy&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll partner closely with leaders across People, Recruiting, Finance, and the broader business to answer important organizational questions, develop scalable analytical frameworks, and improve how decisions are made.&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, flexible hybrid position based out of our Oakland, CA or NYC, NY office. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration. There is no mandate on the number of days required but we encourage employees to come in every week to collaborate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;SQL (BigQuery / Snowflake)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;dbt / dbt State&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Looker / LookML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Sigma / Hex / Google Sheets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Claude Code / Codex&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;HRIS, ATS, and other People systems and data sources&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and own our core People metrics.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish clear definitions and reporting across areas such as headcount, hiring, retention, organizational health, employee experience, and talent development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable analytical products.&lt;/strong&gt; Create canonical datasets, models, and self-service tools and dashboards that enable People teams and leaders to answer important questions quickly and consistently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as a trusted thought partner.&lt;/strong&gt; Translate analyses into clear narratives and recommendations for audiences ranging from functional operators to senior executive leadership. Work closely with our Engineers to improve Fivetran&#39;s own HRIS and ATS connectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a high bar for responsible People Analytics.&lt;/strong&gt; Help establish strong practices around data quality, integrity, governance, privacy, appropriate access, and the responsible use of sensitive employee data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn people data into decisions.&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze complex and disparate datasets to identify trends, surface opportunities, and provide actionable recommendations to People leaders and business stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our analytics culture.&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor other analysts and partners, establish analytical best practices, and help People teams develop stronger data fluency and decision-making habits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in analytics, data science, business intelligence, or a related analytical role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL and data modeling, with experience working across large, complex datasets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using Looker, Tableau, Sigma, or similar business intelligence and visualization tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical judgment and a track record of translating ambiguous business questions into structured analyses and actionable recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and a high bar for data quality, analytical rigor, and reproducibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and data storytelling skills; you can make complex findings intuitive and help decision-makers understand not just what is happening, but why it matters and what to do next&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in ambiguity, developing hypotheses, and owning analytical problems end-to-end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong cross-functional instincts and the ability to build trusted relationships with both technical and non-technical partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A builder mindset: you look beyond answering one-off questions and create frameworks, datasets, and tools that make future decisions faster and better&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for using data to improve how organizations attract, develop, and support their people&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using analytics to support key business decisions, preferably at a high-growth, SaaS, or B2B product company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in People Analytics, workforce analytics, recruiting analytics, HR strategy, or another People-related analytical function&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with HRIS, ATS, performance management, engagement, or learning systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID #LI-DJ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$156,082&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,102.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time-off policy (PTO), plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave policy, holidays (including a year end Global Week of Rest), and volunteer days off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact. During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Analyst, Revenue&lt;/strong&gt; to support our CFO and Finance organization on some of the most complex and consequential analytical problems at Fivetran. This role sits at the intersection of finance, data, and applied mathematics, with a focus on understanding, forecasting, and modeling the economic engine of the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll develop sophisticated models for revenue attribution, forecasting, customer behavior, and financial performance; build the underlying data infrastructure that powers company-wide reporting; and partner directly with Finance and executive leadership on decisions that shape the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a highly quantitative role for someone with exceptional numerical intuition, rigorous logical thinking, and an unusually high bar for accuracy. You’ll work on problems where small errors can have meaningful downstream consequences, and where the best solution often requires going beyond standard reporting into mathematical modeling, statistical methods, or machine learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you enjoy decomposing ambiguous business problems into precise mathematical frameworks, stress-testing assumptions, and building models that become foundational to how a company operates, this role offers the opportunity to work on some of our hardest analytical challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, flexible hybrid position based out of our Oakland, CA office. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration. There is no mandate on the number of days required but we encourage employees to come in every week to collaborate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;SQL (BigQuery / Snowflake)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;dbt / dbt State&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Looker / LookML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Sigma / Hex / Google Sheets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Claude Code / Codex&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Netsuite, CRM, and customer data and billing systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop sophisticated revenue models.&lt;/strong&gt; Build, maintain, and improve complex mathematical models used to project, attribute, analyze, and understand Fivetran’s revenue, customers, and underlying business drivers. Work in an environment with a strong emphasis on mathematical reasoning, robust logic, numerical precision, and analytical rigor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own revenue attribution and financial logic.&lt;/strong&gt; Design frameworks that accurately connect revenue to customers, products, contracts, usage, and other business dimensions, including complex attribution problems that require careful mathematical treatment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and improve revenue forecasting.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop models that project revenue and customer behavior using historical trends, leading indicators, statistical methods, and machine learning. Continuously evaluate forecast accuracy and improve model performance over time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable analytical infrastructure.&lt;/strong&gt; Create data models, pipelines, and automated systems that are reliable, optimized, and scalable, enabling timely analytics and reporting for more than 2,000 stakeholders across the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain an exceptionally high bar for quality.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop rigorous validation, testing, and quality-assurance processes for financial data and analytical models. Identify edge cases, challenge assumptions, and ensure outputs can withstand scrutiny from Finance and executive leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner closely with Finance leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with the CFO organization and cross-functional leaders to translate complex business questions into analytical frameworks, define business rules, establish metrics and targets, and communicate findings clearly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive executive-level decision making.&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct high-impact, in-depth analyses that inform company strategy, financial planning, resource allocation, growth initiatives, and other critical business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embody ownership and operational excellence.&lt;/strong&gt; Take responsibility for the correctness and reliability of your work, continuously improve existing systems and methodologies, and raise the analytical bar for the broader team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4+ years of experience in analytics, data science, business intelligence, or a related analytical role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL and data modeling, with experience working across large, complex datasets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exceptional quantitative ability and numerical intuition, with a strong foundation in mathematics, logic, statistics, and analytical problem-solving&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using Looker, Tableau, Sigma, or similar business intelligence and visualization tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical judgment and a track record of translating ambiguous business questions into structured analyses and actionable recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and a high bar for data quality, analytical rigor, and reproducibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and data storytelling skills; you can make complex findings intuitive and help decision-makers understand not just what is happening, but why it matters and what to do next&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in ambiguity, developing hypotheses, and owning analytical problems end-to-end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong cross-functional instincts and the ability to build trusted relationships with both technical and non-technical partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A builder mindset: you look beyond answering one-off questions and create frameworks, datasets, and tools that make future decisions faster and better&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for using data to improve how organizations attract, develop, and support their people&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using analytics to support key business decisions, preferably at a high-growth, SaaS, or B2B product company&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID #LI-DJ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Oakland Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$156,082&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,102.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time-off policy (PTO), plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave policy, holidays (including a year end Global Week of Rest), and volunteer days off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on. Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact. During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Analyst, Revenue&lt;/strong&gt; to support our CFO and Finance organization on some of the most complex and consequential analytical problems at Fivetran. This role sits at the intersection of finance, data, and applied mathematics, with a focus on understanding, forecasting, and modeling the economic engine of the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll develop sophisticated models for revenue attribution, forecasting, customer behavior, and financial performance; build the underlying data infrastructure that powers company-wide reporting; and partner directly with Finance and executive leadership on decisions that shape the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a highly quantitative role for someone with exceptional numerical intuition, rigorous logical thinking, and an unusually high bar for accuracy. You’ll work on problems where small errors can have meaningful downstream consequences, and where the best solution often requires going beyond standard reporting into mathematical modeling, statistical methods, or machine learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you enjoy decomposing ambiguous business problems into precise mathematical frameworks, stress-testing assumptions, and building models that become foundational to how a company operates, this role offers the opportunity to work on some of our hardest analytical challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, flexible hybrid position based out of our New York, NY office. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration. There is no mandate on the number of days required but we encourage employees to come in every week to collaborate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;SQL (BigQuery / Snowflake)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;dbt / dbt State&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Looker / LookML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Sigma / Hex / Google Sheets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Claude Code / Codex&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Netsuite, CRM, and customer data and billing systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop sophisticated revenue models.&lt;/strong&gt; Build, maintain, and improve complex mathematical models used to project, attribute, analyze, and understand Fivetran’s revenue, customers, and underlying business drivers. Work in an environment with a strong emphasis on mathematical reasoning, robust logic, numerical precision, and analytical rigor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own revenue attribution and financial logic.&lt;/strong&gt; Design frameworks that accurately connect revenue to customers, products, contracts, usage, and other business dimensions, including complex attribution problems that require careful mathematical treatment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and improve revenue forecasting.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop models that project revenue and customer behavior using historical trends, leading indicators, statistical methods, and machine learning. Continuously evaluate forecast accuracy and improve model performance over time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable analytical infrastructure.&lt;/strong&gt; Create data models, pipelines, and automated systems that are reliable, optimized, and scalable, enabling timely analytics and reporting for more than 2,000 stakeholders across the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain an exceptionally high bar for quality.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop rigorous validation, testing, and quality-assurance processes for financial data and analytical models. Identify edge cases, challenge assumptions, and ensure outputs can withstand scrutiny from Finance and executive leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner closely with Finance leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with the CFO organization and cross-functional leaders to translate complex business questions into analytical frameworks, define business rules, establish metrics and targets, and communicate findings clearly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive executive-level decision making.&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct high-impact, in-depth analyses that inform company strategy, financial planning, resource allocation, growth initiatives, and other critical business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embody ownership and operational excellence.&lt;/strong&gt; Take responsibility for the correctness and reliability of your work, continuously improve existing systems and methodologies, and raise the analytical bar for the broader team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4+ years of experience in analytics, data science, business intelligence, or a related analytical role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL and data modeling, with experience working across large, complex datasets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exceptional quantitative ability and numerical intuition, with a strong foundation in mathematics, logic, statistics, and analytical problem-solving&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using Looker, Tableau, Sigma, or similar business intelligence and visualization tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical judgment and a track record of translating ambiguous business questions into structured analyses and actionable recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and a high bar for data quality, analytical rigor, and reproducibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and data storytelling skills; you can make complex findings intuitive and help decision-makers understand not just what is happening, but why it matters and what to do next&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in ambiguity, developing hypotheses, and owning analytical problems end-to-end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong cross-functional instincts and the ability to build trusted relationships with both technical and non-technical partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A builder mindset: you look beyond answering one-off questions and create frameworks, datasets, and tools that make future decisions faster and better&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for using data to improve how organizations attract, develop, and support their people&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using analytics to support key business decisions, preferably at a high-growth, SaaS, or B2B product company&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID #LI-DJ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$156,082&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,102.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid medical insurance&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time-off policy (PTO), plus paid sick time, inclusive parental leave policy, holidays (including a year end Global Week of Rest), and volunteer days off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSU stock grants*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company virtual happy hours, free food, and fun team-building activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to an innovative mental health support platform that offers personalized care and resources in areas such as: therapy, coaching, and self-guided mindfulness exercises for all covered employees and their covered dependents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;May vary by country and worker type - please reach out to your recruiter for more information&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdawUwjo1Q1B7ghZJ_owdmmHB8VtqhBu?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about Fivetran&#39;s Benefits by Region.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We’re honored to be &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/blog/hvr-acquisition-series-d&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;valued at over $5.6 billion&lt;/a&gt;, but more importantly, we’re proud of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran.com/culture&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;core values of Get Stuck In, Do the Right Thing, and One Team, One Dream&lt;/a&gt;. Read about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fivetran-com.s3.amazonaws.com/news/forbes-aug-sept-2022-digital-reprint-10-21-22.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Forbes&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;Fivetran brings together high-quality talent across the globe to make data access as easy and reliable as electricity for our customers. We value and recognize that our customers benefit from having innovative teams made of people from many backgrounds, experiences, and identities. Fivetran promotes diversity, equity, inclusion &amp;amp; belonging through attracting, recruiting, developing, and retaining a diverse workforce, not only because it is the right thing to do, but because it helps us build a world-class company to better serve our customers, our people and our communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about Fivetran’s culture and what it’s like to be part of the team, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xlhtp4dGh8o&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; and enjoy our video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;To learn more about our candidate privacy policy, you can &lt;a href=&quot;https://fivetran.com/candidate-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read our statement here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to ensuring that all candidates have an equal opportunity to participate in our interview process. If you require accommodations at any stage of the process due to a disability, medical condition, or any other circumstance, please don&#39;t hesitate to submit your request by filling out this &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/V7k3t4u9j523XkEt6&quot;&gt;form&lt;/a&gt;. We will work with you to provide reasonable accommodations to facilitate your participation and ensure a fair and accessible interview experience. Your request and any information provided will be kept confidential and will not impact your candidacy. We look forward to hearing from you and accommodating your needs to the best of our ability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Together, we&#39;re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we&#39;re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It&#39;s an exciting time to join us: we&#39;re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Developer Experience Advocate&lt;/strong&gt; to join the Developer Experience (DX) team at dbt Labs — a team of dbt experts on the forefront of serving dbt developers and building the next generation of data workflows. We partner across our internal product and go-to-market teams, as well as across the dbt Community, operating using the PRIME framework: Prototype, Represent, Ideate, Maintain, and Enable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a senior, high-impact role for a data engineering generalist who wants to spend their time in public. You will execute developer experience and developer relations work across our product surface — such as dbt State, dbt Fusion, and dbt Wizard, and the Fivetran connector SDK — helping practitioners succeed with our tools and raising our thought leadership in open data infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are looking for someone with broad, hard-won knowledge of the data industry: how data teams actually work, where the tooling helps, and where it gets in the way. You will translate that knowledge into content, prototypes, community engagement, and product feedback. AI is reshaping parts of this landscape and you should be comfortable working with it and curious about where it goes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a highly autonomous role. You will set your own priorities, communicate them clearly, and deliver high-quality work without heavy direction. In exchange you get real ownership of a focus area, significant internal and external visibility, and leadership that protects your time rather than managing your calendar. We&#39;re looking for someone who can hit the ground running — shipping meaningful work within their first two weeks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, fully remote position based in the United States. This role reports to the Director of Community, Developer Experience &amp;amp; AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design and build prototypes, reference implementations, and example repositories that show practitioners how to get real work done with our tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Create working prototypes that validate product direction and accelerate engineering iteration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Build tooling that removes friction from common analytics engineering workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Author technical content for the dbt Developer Blog, guides, and documentation that makes complex concepts actionable for practitioners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Publish knowledge and best practices on data and analytics engineering that establish you as a resource in your product area&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop enablement resources for internal teams and the dbt Community, and contribute to product launches as a subject matter expert&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Represent your product area as a community voice across Community Slack, GitHub, conferences, and public forums&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collect and synthesize community feedback, surfacing insights to product and engineering, and bring the practitioner perspective into product design reviews&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and flag sharp edges, regressions, or gaps in the developer experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain and triage relevant open source repositories and community projects, contributing code and design reviews with an eye toward developer ergonomics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;5+ years in data engineering, analytics engineering, or a closely related field, with strong general knowledge of the data industry and how it is changing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on dbt knowledge and practitioner-level fluency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Expert public communication in both spoken and written technical contexts, with a track record of published articles or public-facing content on data or analytics engineering — we will want to read and watch your work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong data and analytics engineering fundamentals, including comfort with Python and SQL and the ability to contribute to open source codebases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort and familiarity with AI, and enthusiasm for adapting AI into how you work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to work autonomously as a self-starter, delivering high-quality output with minimal direction, with the operational rigor to set priorities and communicate them clearly at multiple cadences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong product sense, the ability to translate user needs into concrete product feedback, and genuine enthusiasm for a public-facing role over internal product or engineering work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;An existing footprint in the dbt Community, or prior hands-on use of dbt tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Background in developer relations, developer experience, or developer advocacy at a developer tools company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience building with or for AI coding agents, and fluency with how the AI agent ecosystem is evolving&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contributions to open source projects in the data ecosystem (packages, adapters, community tools)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Public speaking experience at data or developer conferences, and experience with Fusion and the dbt platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
