&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with LLM-powered applications — RAG pipelines, embeddings, evaluation frameworks, or agent frameworks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with semantic layers — dbt, LookML, Sigma, or similar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with the MCP (Model Context Protocol) ecosystem or building AI agent integrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
