&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This position qualifies for Fivetran’s incentive plan, and it’s common for employees in this role to achieve the total on-target earnings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
