&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive innovation by evaluating new technologies and engineering approaches, including AI-assisted development workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
