&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Java, SQL, Kubernetes, Docker, AWS, GCP, BuildKite, Github Copilot, Claude Code, Codex.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
