&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve worked as a People/HR Business Partner, or in a role where you&#39;ve coached managers and dealt with meaningful people and team challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
