&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drive the roadmap for the future of Fivetran’s API connector development by leveraging AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
